es and passes in a reactor that has no\n      test dependency.\n    steps_to_reproduce:\n      - \"Take the reactor of the story (`domain`, `infrastructure`) without any test dependency, and adopt its map.\"\n      - \"Qualify the architecture control by its witnesses: the positive witness gives INDETERMINATE with « package org.junit.jupiter.api does not exist » at `domain/src/test/java/witness495/PositiveWitness495Test.java`.\"\n    root_cause: >\n      The witnesses of the controls of a Maven target are JUnit 5 tests, written for the test control; the\n      architecture control takes the same positive witness although it compiles the project's test sources\n      without running them.\n    evidence: >\n      Found while writing `test/v4-platform/maven-architecture-offline.test.ts`: with a reactor that declares no\n      JUnit, the qualification gave positive and negative INDETERMINATE on the compilation of the witness; the\n      test declares JUnit 5 in the root POM to reach the defect it holds.\n    risk_level: medium\n    follow_ups: >\n      Give the architecture control a positive witness that compiles without a test framework, such as a main\n      class of a mapped package that keeps the map, with a platform test on a reactor that declares no JUnit.\n    status: open\ne11s01-495-propose-la-carte-d-architecture-d-une-cible-maven.md\ne11s02-l-etat-des-lieux-verifie-la-carte-adoptee-avec-archunit.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MMZxG57sCB91K53KfxqU3o","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"classifier"}}]}
